WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Open Account Access on your Mac.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:10.717
Click Install. Account Access prepares the software for you. Wait until the setup

00:00:10.717 --> 00:00:17.733
screen opens.

00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:23.583
Choose Claude Code, Codex, or both. Then click Set up my AI tools. The app adds

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:29.433
the Account Access skill for you.

00:00:29.433 --> 00:00:35.283
Choose an account. Enter its username or email and password once. Approve what

00:00:35.283 --> 00:00:41.133
your AI can read, then click Connect account.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:47.483
Repeat for the work account, using its separate login. Approve the product read

00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:53.833
and connect it.

00:00:53.833 --> 00:01:00.850
Add the membership account and approve its welcome message read. When all three

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:07.867
accounts turn green, you're ready.

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:13.550
You won't retype these passwords during the task. Copy the request and open Claude

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:19.233
Code.

00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:22.633
In a fresh Claude Code chat, ask for the work. One request starts all three

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:26.033
account reads.

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:31.883
Claude discovers the permitted accounts and starts one task. The example sessions

00:01:31.883 --> 00:01:37.733
were expired, so you can watch fresh sign-ins.

00:01:37.733 --> 00:01:42.917
The first shopping account opens. Account Access fills the saved username and

00:01:42.917 --> 00:01:48.100
masked password, then signs in. The user leaves the login form alone.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.533
Next, it signs into the work account automatically, using its separate saved

00:01:52.533 --> 00:01:56.967
login. It then reads product names and prices.

00:01:56.967 --> 00:02:02.667
Then it signs into the membership account and reads the welcome message. No

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:08.367
password entry or login clicks are needed from the user.

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:12.744
Claude shows the results from all three accounts. Both shopping accounts have the

00:02:12.744 --> 00:02:17.122
same cheapest product at seven dollars and ninety-nine cents. The membership

00:02:17.122 --> 00:02:21.500
welcome message is included, and the task is saved.
